        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_02",
      "hash64": "07B49D6934A105A3",
      "text": "Today’s guest is our brand spankin’ newest\\nChampion, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_03",
      "hash64": "07B49C6934A103F0",
      "text": "You’ve gone viral among the Gym Leaders,\\nfriendo! You’re all we’re talkin’ about recently![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_04",
      "hash64": "07B4A36934A10FD5",
      "text": "I remember your Gym Test well! It was—bzzzt!—\\nshocking![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_05",
      "hash64": "07B4A26934A10E22",
      "text": "This stream’s gonna trend like crazy! I can’t wait\\nto see those viewer numbers go up, up, up![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_06",
      "hash64": "07B4A16934A10C6F",
      "text": "All riiiiiight. Here we go. Got that camera set up\\njust how I like it.[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_07",
      "hash64": "07B4A06934A10ABC",
      "text": "I ’unno ’bout you all, but I’m ready to get this\\nbattle started![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_08",
      "hash64": "07B4A76934A116A1",
      "text": "We’ll call this stream “Gym Leader Iono Battles\\nLike You’ve NEVER Seen Before!”[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_09",
      "hash64": "07B4A66934A114EE",
      "text": "Awww, man. I’m not super happy about losing,\\ny’know, but...[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_10",
      "hash64": "07B11969349DEF80",
      "text": "look at those viewer numbers! The Iono Zone’s\\non a roll today! I’m on cloud nine! No—cloud ten![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_11",
      "hash64": "07B11A69349DF133",
      "text": "Havin’ someone as popular as you on my stream\\nwas a great idea! I’m trendin’ like the internet’s\\r\\nmad at me![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 110,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_12",
      "hash64": "07B11B69349DF2E6",
      "text": "We should collab like this regularly! Don’t go\\nappearin’ on any other channels, though![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_13",
      "hash64": "07B11C69349DF499",
      "text": "All right! I ’unno ’bout you, but I’m DONE! Tell\\nLa Primera what a sensation I was, OK?[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2020_denki_020_denki_134",
      "hash64": "AFE7F3C46866C1F7",
      "text": "Your eyeballs are MINE—caught in my\\nElectroweb! Whosawhatsit? Iono...signing off![VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
